{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33996","headline":"伤进士严子重诗 · 皮日休","name":"伤进士严子重诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十哭都门牓上尘，盖棺终是五湖人。\n生前有敌唯丹桂，没後无家秖白苹。\n箬下斩新醒处月，江南依旧咏来春。\n知君精爽应无尽，必在酆都颂帝晨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}